      ],
      "schema:description": "Hydrogenated cannabinoid derivatives: HHC, HHCH, H4CBH and HHBD. Evidence: the category column of research/google-trends/20261004-google-trends-compound-summary.md and the scopeNotes of jptr:compound-hhc and jptr:compound-h4cbh. Route placement differs per compound (semi-synthetic vs synthetic); that is the point of the second dimension.",
